    "p_value": "one-sided, from n_boot paired cluster-bootstrap resamples of the statistic (one resample of clusters applies to every cell of the hypothesis; the same resamples for every hypothesis): p = (1 + #{resampled statistic <= 0}) / (n_boot + 1)",
